# ============================================================================
# VERSION 0.2.6 - Clean & Optimized (Production Ready)
# ============================================================================
# Changes from 0.2.5:
# 
# DATABASE OPTIMIZATION (Eliminates 15+ second freezes):
# - Replaced all in-memory track lookups with SQLite DB queries
# - process_external_request() uses song_index.find_by_artist_title() (<1ms)
# - lookup_display_name() uses song_index.find_by_path() (<1ms)
# - Scales to 100k+ tracks with instant lookups
# 
# GSTREAMER FIXES (Prevents Windows UI freezes):
# - All playback methods use async teardown (_gst_teardown_async)
# - Prevents 30-60s blocking on Windows during song transitions
# - Reduced polling timeout from 30s to 10s
# 
# CODE CLEANUP:
# - Removed all FFmpeg/VLC dead code (key change now 100% GStreamer)
# - Removed PROCESSED_DIR and file cleanup (no longer needed)
# - Removed KeyChangeWorker class (obsolete)
# 
# SMART POLLING (Auto-start/stop with self-healing):
# - Only polls when network is configured and connected
# - Auto-retries with backoff (60s) when connection lost
# - Auto-reconnects when network comes back
# - No manual intervention needed
# 
# DIAGNOSTICS (Keep for troubleshooting):
# - Freeze detector (warns if UI freezes >5s)
# - Network polling timing logs
# - GStreamer teardown timing logs
# - Database lookup timing logs
# 
# song_index.py enhancements:
# - idx_songs_artist_title composite index for fast exact matches
# - idx_songs_path index for instant path lookups  
# - find_by_artist_title() for external request processing
# - find_by_path() for display name lookups
# ============================================================================

